@startuml Sequence - WebSocket Lifecycle
!theme plain
title WebSocket Connection Lifecycle — Subscribe, Stream, Reconnect

actor "Dashboard\n(app.js)" as client
participant "FastAPI\n(websocket.py)" as ws
participant "Signal Store\n(signal_store.py)" as store
participant "Repository\n(repository.py)" as repo

== 1. Connection & Authentication ==
client -> ws : ws://host/ws/signals?token=<api_key>
note right of client : Topic-based endpoints:\nws://host/ws/signals\nws://host/ws/alarms\nws://host/ws/all
ws -> ws : validate token
alt invalid token
    ws --> client : Close(4001, "Unauthorized")
else valid
    ws --> client : Connection accepted
end

== 2. Initial Snapshot + Config ==
ws -> store : get_snapshot()
store --> ws : {all signals with values}
ws -> client : {"type":"snapshot",\n "data":{"VehicleSpeed":{"value":84.1,"status":"ok"}, ...}}

ws -> repo : get_all_configs()
repo --> ws : List[SignalConfig]
loop for each signal
    ws -> client : {"type":"signal_config",\n "signal":"VehicleSpeed",\n "unit":"km/h","min":0,"max":655.35, ...}
end

== 3. Real-time Streaming ==
loop continuous
    store -> ws : notify(signal_update)
    alt client consuming normally
        ws -> client : {"type":"signal_update",\n "data":{"VehicleSpeed":{"value":85.3,"status":"ok"}}}
    else client too slow (buffer full)
        ws -> ws : drop oldest message\nlog warning
    end
end

== 4. Alarm Events ==
store -> ws : notify(alarm)
ws -> client : {"type":"alarm",\n "signal":"CoolantTemp","level":"warning",\n "value":97.2,"threshold":95}

== 5. Heartbeat ==
note over ws : Runs concurrently with streaming\n(asyncio task)
loop every 5 seconds (configurable: ws_heartbeat_interval_sec)
    ws -> client : {"type":"heartbeat",\n "timestamp":1742000005.0,\n "uptime_sec":1425}
end

== 6. Disconnection & Reconnect ==
client ->x ws : Connection lost
note over client : Detect: no heartbeat for 15s
client -> client : Reconnect with\nexponential backoff\n(1s → 2s → 4s → ... → 30s max)
client -> ws : ws://host/ws/signals?token=<api_key>
ws --> client : Connection accepted
note over ws : Re-send snapshot + signal_config\n(see step 2)

@enduml
